  "Q00100_SagaOfTheMaestro/10-07.htm": {
   "file": "Q00100_SagaOfTheMaestro/10-07.htm",
   "quest": 100,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Nothing happens any more even when you lay your hands on the tablet. Now that you have finished your pilgrimage of the tablet, go back to Rune Castle Town and see Chief Golem Crafter Telson .",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "when": [
    "cond 19; !((npcId == 31592) && st.isCompleted()); player.getClassId().getId() == getPrevClass(player)"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 67,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Suddenly you feel a chill, and then see the flash of a blade! When you open your eyes you discover that a mortal blow was blocked...",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 67,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The tablet is still and dark. You must speak with Harkilgamed over there.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 67,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: There's a disturbance near the tablet, but it's not your business. Don't get involved. Come back when it's time.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/10-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/10-06.htm",
   "quest": 67,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Thoughts beyond your understanding race through your mind, and you hear the sound of distant laughter. A man in black armor says, \"So it seems that another of your heroes has been born.\" A lady in blue replis, \"No, this one is still a child just beginning to take his first halting…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00073_SagaOfTheDuelist/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00073_SagaOfTheDuelist/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 73,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: This devil you fight is the one that tempted Sword Master Iron with eternal life and defeated him.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00073_SagaOfTheDuelist/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00073_SagaOfTheDuelist/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 73,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Talk with Kain van Halter.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00073_SagaOfTheDuelist/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00073_SagaOfTheDuelist/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 73,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Come back when it's your turn to fight.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00073_SagaOfTheDuelist/10-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00073_SagaOfTheDuelist/10-06.htm",
   "quest": 73,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. It seems that I heard someone laughing. The man said. \"One more hero you wanted is born here again.\" A lady with blue clothes answered. \"No, he is just a baby who starts toddling. But, he won't be raised under…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00077_SagaOfTheDominator/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00077_SagaOfTheDominator/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 77,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Darkness surrounds the king who is not king. Flame Successor Akkan rules the kingdom in all but name.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00077_SagaOfTheDominator/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00077_SagaOfTheDominator/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 77,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The tablet is still and dark. Akkan turns this way and smiles.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00077_SagaOfTheDominator/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00077_SagaOfTheDominator/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 77,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: There is someone else here. You hear fighting.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00077_SagaOfTheDominator/10-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00077_SagaOfTheDominator/10-06.htm",
   "quest": 77,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Great knowledge rushes into your mind. You hear the sound of distant laughter. A voice whispers, \"Another Hero is born.\" A lady in blue answers, \"No, he's just beginning. I can't give him much power yet, but he conjured the soul himself and filled my brother's vacancy.\" As the pow…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00081_SagaOfTheGhostHunter/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00081_SagaOfTheGhostHunter/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 81,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: A powerful energy appears.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00081_SagaOfTheGhostHunter/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00081_SagaOfTheGhostHunter/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 81,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The tablet is still and dark. Speak with the Hero.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00081_SagaOfTheGhostHunter/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00081_SagaOfTheGhostHunter/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 81,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone is currently communing with the tablet. Try again later.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00081_SagaOfTheGhostHunter/10-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00081_SagaOfTheGhostHunter/10-06.htm",
   "quest": 81,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: An old, familiar energy enters your body. Suddenly, a new, even more intense feeling appears! All the pleasure, pain, anger and love of the previous challengers of this power course through your veins! The screams you hear are your own. But are they real or imagined? You feel cons…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00093_SagaOfTheSpectralMaster/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00093_SagaOfTheSpectralMaster/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 93,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: As you are about to lay your hands on the tablet, you can feel something behind you. And a new creature that you haven't seen before appears.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00093_SagaOfTheSpectralMaster/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00093_SagaOfTheSpectralMaster/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 93,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You need the Stone of Commune to decipher the hieroglyphs on the tablet. Speak with the Mysterious Servitor about the Stone of Commune.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00093_SagaOfTheSpectralMaster/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00093_SagaOfTheSpectralMaster/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 93,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone is currently communing with the tablet. Try again later.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00093_SagaOfTheSpectralMaster/10-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00093_SagaOfTheSpectralMaster/10-06.htm",
   "quest": 93,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: As you hold the Stone of Commune and concentrate on it, the tablet gets surrounded by bright light. You hear several hundred people simultaneously reading scriptures, and new knowledge starts to enter your mind. On one hand, you feel like you understand everything. On the other ha…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00095_SagaOfTheHellKnight/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00095_SagaOfTheHellKnight/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 95,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You see two figures! It's Waldstein and Death Lord Hallate. Hallate has the Stone of Commune!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00095_SagaOfTheHellKnight/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00095_SagaOfTheHellKnight/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 95,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Listen to Waldstein first.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00095_SagaOfTheHellKnight/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00095_SagaOfTheHellKnight/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 95,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone around here has the Stone of Commune, but it's too noisy now. Try again later when things quiet down a bit.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00095_SagaOfTheHellKnight/10-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00095_SagaOfTheHellKnight/10-06.htm",
   "quest": 95,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: A sharp blast of knowlege courses through your cranium! You hear the sound of distant laughter. A man announces the birth of another Hero. The woman in blue disagrees... This is the last time she'll see the child! Communion with the six Tablets of Vision is complete. You've alread…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00096_SagaOfTheSpectralDancer/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00096_SagaOfTheSpectralDancer/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 96,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Death Lord Hallate suddenly appears in the corner! Something seems to be holding him back...",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00096_SagaOfTheSpectralDancer/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00096_SagaOfTheSpectralDancer/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 96,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Further communion with this tablet would be pointless at this time. Get the next Stone of Commune from Hallate and Scryde.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00096_SagaOfTheSpectralDancer/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00096_SagaOfTheSpectralDancer/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 96,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: There's a disturbance nearby. I'd better not get involved right now... I'll wait a while.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00096_SagaOfTheSpectralDancer/10-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00096_SagaOfTheSpectralDancer/10-06.htm",
   "quest": 96,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: This time, the flood of knowledge was painless! Now you understand the forbidden strength and the resulting fate. Go back to Dark Knight Modred in Hardin .",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00100_SagaOfTheMaestro/10-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00100_SagaOfTheMaestro/10-02.htm",
   "quest": 100,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: As you are about to lay your hands on the tablet, you can feel something behind you. And a new creature that you haven't seen before appears...",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00100_SagaOfTheMaestro/10-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00100_SagaOfTheMaestro/10-03.htm",
   "quest": 100,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You need the Stone of Commune to decipher the hieroglyphs on the tablet. Speak with Master Tobalt about the Stone of Commune.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00100_SagaOfTheMaestro/10-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00100_SagaOfTheMaestro/10-04.htm",
   "quest": 100,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone is already communing with the tablet. Try again later.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00100_SagaOfTheMaestro/10-06.htm": {
